      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;â€œGive me a proper kiss tomorrow?â€&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€œThatâ€™s if you remember any of this.â€&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;They only ever make progress when they're drunk. The problem is they almost always barely remember. Or do they?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;â€”&lt;br&gt;Bow's leaving for college and Glimmer's staying behind, but not after a farewell party turns into a drunken confession they'll pretend never happened.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
